   </td>   <td width="100" style="width:74.9pt;border-top:none;border-left:none;   border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;   padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt">   <p class="ckhrilixml"><span lang="RU">3</span></p>
